                        "source_sense_id": "4162cbbb-ae04-347f-8fca-ed14ca87c555",
                        "source_sense_description": "mittelalterliches Verfahren für ein Gottesurteil",
                        "target_lang_word": "épreuve du feu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "épreuve du feu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8cab33a-d5e0-303b-a459-f101a5c80294",
                                        "entry_id": "0a3ea6db-d42b-357f-a934-31ce91ea7082",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action difficile dans laquelle il faut prouver ses capacités."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd3fa925-c7bb-482e-83ae-c368ad4e7126",
                                                "sense_id": "b8cab33a-d5e0-303b-a459-f101a5c80294",
                                                "text": "Défiler en public sur un podium représente l’épreuve du feu pour une mannequin. Il faut savoir marcher, porter le vêtement, faire son cinéma… Personnellement, j’ai commencé à défiler très jeune."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5883c187-c7b2-4820-ae49-f4cc3b258937",
                        "source_entry_id": "c4652c37-1545-31dc-afbc-e06478188e0a",
                        "source_sense_id": "4162cbbb-ae04-347f-8fca-ed14ca87c555",
                        "source_sense_description": "mittelalterliches Verfahren für ein Gottesurteil",
                        "target_lang_word": "ordalie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ordalie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "442dfcae-7741-36b2-9894-fbfd0f939132",
                                        "entry_id": "a7c626e2-ab1e-3a7a-baf0-e3b322eeaa6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Épreuve, allant jusqu’à la torture, usitée au Moyen Âge comme preuve en justice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3daa8c24-b88c-46c6-8819-481a4452ba2a",
                                                "sense_id": "442dfcae-7741-36b2-9894-fbfd0f939132",
                                                "text": "Quant à l’hypothèse, sous-introduite au moyen âge, qui tendrait à faire de la guerre, à la façon de l’ordalie ou combat judiciaire, une manifestation de la volonté du ciel, il va sans dire que Grotius et ses successeurs la rejettent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e6ef478-2f7b-43f3-9ba3-63cbb696b630",
                                                "sense_id": "442dfcae-7741-36b2-9894-fbfd0f939132",
                                                "text": "Divination par l’entraille et le souffle et la palpitation du souffle ! Divination par l’eau du ciel et l’ordalie des fleuves…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4c52a0f-795f-4d38-9369-db3b83a285e3",
                                                "sense_id": "442dfcae-7741-36b2-9894-fbfd0f939132",
                                                "text": "On leur a enseigné les vertus des plantes et la manière de procéder à des ordalies, truquées ou non, le Jugement de Dieu ayant été d'abord le Jugement des Dieux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b187b6-4643-4129-b11f-bf9890257f5e",
                                                "sense_id": "442dfcae-7741-36b2-9894-fbfd0f939132",
                                                "text": "Grâce au tribunal de la Sainte Inquisition, la sorcière était soumise à l’ordalie qui pouvait l’innocenter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8200ee8e-ed0e-4e71-8242-1eafa06dd350",
                        "source_entry_id": "c4652c37-1545-31dc-afbc-e06478188e0a",
                        "source_sense_id": "fec6b63d-0c53-3e2d-874a-c7dd870033a2",
                        "source_sense_description": "Situation, in der eine Person zeigen soll, dass sie hohen Anforderungen gewachsen ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "crucible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "crucible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e90b917-0203-3213-adf4-af516a27fdc4",
                                        "entry_id": "e7e531fb-ef87-3618-8302-fe99e24a646c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cup-shaped piece of laboratory equipment used to contain chemical compounds when heating them to very high temperatures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8757e926-7681-4f1b-9707-beadca41dacc",
                                                "sense_id": "0e90b917-0203-3213-adf4-af516a27fdc4",
                                                "text": "In one corner of the closet was a very small furnace, with a glowing fire in it, and on the fire a kind of duplicate crucible—two crucibles connected by a tube. One of these crucibles was nearly full of lead in a state of fusion, but not reaching up to the aperture of the tube, which was close to the brim."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf594bb4-d8bf-30ac-b837-3be1b891b40d",
                                        "entry_id": "e7e531fb-ef87-3618-8302-fe99e24a646c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A heat-resistant container in which metals are melted, usually at temperatures above 500°C, commonly made of graphite with clay as a binder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b6ce7f4-f54a-3a60-91bf-7423d7a11a59",
                                        "entry_id": "e7e531fb-ef87-3618-8302-fe99e24a646c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The bottom and hottest part of a blast furnace; the hearth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc603ec0-ce99-3290-a2d7-ca8567566b48",
                                        "entry_id": "e7e531fb-ef87-3618-8302-fe99e24a646c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very difficult and trying experience, that acts as a refining or hardening process."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcad3650-2f18-417d-bbc2-28701300ed84",
                                                "sense_id": "cc603ec0-ce99-3290-a2d7-ca8567566b48",
                                                "text": "But, in considering an author and his works as one, a sufficient distinction is not drawn between the ideal and the real: the last is only given by being past through the crucible of the first."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b03b516b-5092-4c00-915c-2be5974869be",
                                                "sense_id": "cc603ec0-ce99-3290-a2d7-ca8567566b48",
                                                "text": "We should give our support to the liberation of the captive nations of the world and deliver our compatriots from their crucible of suffering. In other words, we should take up the difficult task of reshaping the world’s destiny by destroying the tyrannical Communist rule now afflicting the earth and by delivering humankind from the Red holocaust."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2123f297-8899-4037-8d22-c3aa839b63b8",
                                                "sense_id": "cc603ec0-ce99-3290-a2d7-ca8567566b48",
                                                "text": "Some of our ancestors faced trials that we will never know—the snows of Valley Forge; the crucible of a bitter, bloody civil war; and the incredible hardships endured in taming a savage wilderness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2cbaa00-6186-4296-ab77-cc40db453bc3",
                                                "sense_id": "cc603ec0-ce99-3290-a2d7-ca8567566b48",
                                                "text": "Beowulf's mood as he gets ready to fight the dragon - who could be read as a projection of Beowulf's own chthonic wisdom refined in the crucible of experience - recalls the mood of other tragic heroes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
